# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The shared language policy (MWBM-MEDIA-LANG) — exact copies, byte for byte
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These files are copies of master files in MWBMPartners/MeedyaSuite-core.
# scripts/media-lang/check_copies.py (run by CI) compares each one's SHA-256
# checksum with the lock file and with the master. A single changed byte
# fails that check — and a line-ending conversion (a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf turning every "\n" into "\r\n") changes every line. `-text`
# tells git never to convert these files, on any machine.
#
# Never edit the copies. Change the master in MeedyaSuite-core, then take it
# here with: python3 scripts/media-lang/check_copies.py --update <commit>
#
# The lock file is written by the checker rather than copied, but it is read
# back line by line, so it gets the same protection.
docs/standards/media-language-bcp47-policy.md -text
docs/standards/data/bcp47-language-data-v1.json -text
docs/standards/data/bcp47-language-data-v1.schema.json -text
tests/fixtures/bcp47-language-policy-v1.json -text
tests/fixtures/bcp47-language-policy-v1.schema.json -text
scripts/media-lang/check_copies.py -text
docs/standards/MWBM-MEDIA-LANG.lock -text
